WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.570
I manage this studio.

2
00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.850
Monday mornings used to start
with dirty mugs

3
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.690
and a meeting room
that needed clearing.

4
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:09.690
We wanted the team
to arrive ready to work.

5
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.350
Our cleaner now takes care
of the kitchen

6
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:13.870
and meeting room after we close.

7
00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:18.770
I walk in, turn on the lights,
and start the day.

8
00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:21.250
That's the difference.
